<p>Direct link: <a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noreferrer noopener" class=3D"e=
xternal free" href=3D"https://auth.fandom.com/register">https://auth.fandom=
.com/register</a>
</p><p>Next, choose an option to register - you can connect using social me=
dia (Facebook, Google, Twitch, Apple) or register with an email and passwor=
d. After signing up with an email, you will be asked to verify your email, =
so make sure to check your inbox!
</p>
